scaleconnector_java
===================

Description
-----------
The Scale Connector For iDempiere project allows in first place, the materials 
weighing from iDempiere ERP Open Source, thus providing the tools 
necessary to optimize the receipt of raw material and dispatch of 
finished product in the productive chain of a company, saving time 
and resources.

ScaleConnector can be configured to sync with any device or sensor 
(temperature, humidity, pressure, weighing, accountant, etc.) that 
communicate through the RS-232 serial port.


Features
--------
