- Linux and Windows operating systems
- Java 7
- Designed to read RS-232 serial port
- CPU Architecture x86, x86_64
- Apache Tomcat 7


Documentation
-------------
- http://wiki.idempiere.org/en/Plugin:_Scale_Connector


Linux Commands
--------------
- setserial -g /dev/ttyS*
- ls -l /dev/ttyS* 
- gpasswd -a <user> dialout,
- gpasswd -a <user> uucp


Web Services
------------
- URL: http://localhost:8080/scaleconnector_webservice
- URL Service: http://localhost:8080/scaleconnector_webservice/get_response